WEBVTT

00:10.000 --> 00:11.000
I won

00:11.080 --> 00:12.480
Is there a prize?

00:13.240 --> 00:14.600
Defeated by a woman

00:14.800 --> 00:16.200
Uncle

00:16.600 --> 00:19.000
It was originally just to liven things up before the banquet

00:19.080 --> 00:20.040
Young General Zu

00:20.120 --> 00:21.920
Didn't underestimate the opponent at all

00:22.000 --> 00:22.760
Prince of Jin

00:22.840 --> 00:24.240
A precious body

00:24.320 --> 00:25.280
Foundation and techniques

00:25.360 --> 00:26.680
Are all first-rate

00:26.760 --> 00:27.360
It's just that my daughter

00:27.440 --> 00:29.360
Has long fought against the Wutu

00:29.440 --> 00:31.240
Where life and death are decided instantly

00:31.320 --> 00:32.160
When she strikes

00:32.240 --> 00:33.520
She doesn't hold back

00:33.600 --> 00:35.200
I apologize for offending Your Highness

00:35.280 --> 00:36.520
A tiger father has no weak daughter

00:36.600 --> 00:38.000
Young General Zu

00:38.600 --> 00:40.267
This humble one admires you

00:40.880 --> 00:42.680
His Majesty arrives

